Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard): test proxy group delays from the proxy
 groups card

The card shows each group's delay but offered no way to measure it, so a fresh session showed none until the proxies page was opened. A bolt action beside the card title now tests every visible group.

The card now spans a full row, and with a single group it collapses to one line: the proxies glyph, the group and its selected node, and the bolt, instead of a two-line card that is half empty.

Changelog: Test proxy group delays from the dashboard's proxy groups card, which takes one line for a single group
